  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Joint Programme 2024-2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UN Joint Programme 2024-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">JP programmet har tre &#xf6;vergripande resultatomr&#xe5;den:
1) Att ge befolkningen en mer r&#xe4;ttvis tillg&#xe5;ng till grundl&#xe4;ggande samh&#xe4;llsservice s&#xe5;som; electricitet, vatten, utbildning och h&#xe4;lsa.
2) Att ge befolkningen f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrade f&#xf6;rs&#xf6;rjningsm&#xf6;jligheter och h&#xe5;llbara
livsmedelssystem.
3) Att fr&#xe4;mja samexistens och samarbete mellan olika samh&#xe4;llsgrupper.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UN JP is a setup with the aim to strengthen
urban and rural resilience and the conditions for recovery in Syria. It include three outcomes: 1) Women, men, girls and boys have more equitable basic services, such as electricity, water, education and health care. 2) Women, men, girls and boys have enhanced sustainable food systems and livelihood opportunities. 3) Trust, cohesion and cooperation between local communities is enhanced. These outcomes match well the aim of the Swedish Syria crisis strategy 2024-2026.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UN JP aims to strengthen urban and rural resilience and the conditions for recovery in Syria. 

It included three outcomes: 
1) Women, men, girls and boys have more equitable basic services, such as electricity, water, education and health care. 
2) Women, men, girls and boys have enhanced sustainable food systems and livelihood opportunities. 
3) Trust, cohesion and cross-cleavage cooperation between local communities is enhanced.</narrative>
  </description>
